{title: Your Name}
{artist: Paul Baloche, Glenn Packiam}
{key: A#}

{comment: Verse 1}
As [A#/D]morning [D#]dawns and [F]evening [A#5]fades
[A#/D]You [D#]inspire [F]songs of [A#]praise
That [A#/D]rise from [D#]earth to [F]touch Your [Gm7]heart
And [D#]glorify [F]Your [A#5]Name

{comment: Chorus}
Your [Dm7]Name [Gm7]  is a [A#5]strong and mighty [D#2]tower
Your [F]Name [Gm7]  is a [A#5]shelter like no other
Your [F]Name [Gm7]  let the [A#5]nations sing it louder
'Cause [A#/D]nothing has the [D#2]power to [Fsus]save    [F]
But Your [A#/D]Name   [D#]    [F/A]    [A#5]

{comment: Verse 2}
[A#/D]Jesus, [D#]in Your [F]Name we [A#5]pray
[A#/D]Come and [D#]fill our [F]hearts [A#5]today
Lord, [A#/D]give us [D#]strength to [F]live for You
[Gm7]And  [D#]glorify [F]Your [A#5]Name
